A||||2||kevin||Stock stereo questions ||||1||
Z||000000||kevin||07-15-2000||09:08 PM||||I am converting my stock 85 cassette deck to a 95 Firebird unit. I purchased the harness from Best Buy for 16.00 It is supposed to help with the conversion. Is there a sight or place I can go to halp me figure out how to connect the new harness wires to the plugs I disconnected from my stock unit? You guys sure arre terrific!   ||||reg||1
Z||000001||BAM-BAM||07-16-2000||12:25 AM||||  Kevin, With the proper conversion harness it should be plug and play. I put a CD player from a 95 Grand Prix in my 85GT and had no problem. It plugged right into the stock system using the GM harness. I can't recall at this moment what the P/N is but if you call your local GM dealer and let then knoe what you have and what you are putting it into, they will have the correct item. It's no biggie and really easy. It looks awesome too.<P>  Late, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT||||reg||12
Z||000002||tgowens||07-16-2000||03:43 AM||||kevin,<P>you need the adapter (for the wiring harness as well as for the antenna lead) -- it is GM part #16140051 and lists for $18.25 from a dealer.<P>If you have to order the adapter you may want to order it from Bobby at Newell Electronics..... <A HREF="http://www.newellelectronics.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.newellelectronics.com/</A>  he only charges $15 plus the shipping and I have talked to him several times about these radios (unlocking them is his specialty!!) -- also, if you are using the stock subwoofer, splice the two pink wires from the sub amp into the yellow from the wiring harness (white from the new adapter) that will power the sub in the accessory and run position.<P>If you need any additional help, feel free to email me at  <A HREF="mailto:terry@tgowens.com">terry@tgowens.com</A>  -- I have helped quite a few of us Fiero owners replace their older stock radios.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">             <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
